sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Codex
    participant REA as REA MCP
    participant OS as Owned MuMu Android
    Agent->>REA: Inspect focused component
    REA->>OS: Read window manager metadata
    OS-->>Agent: Lawnchair launcher
    Agent->>REA: Normal start of original package
    REA->>OS: Resolve launcher and am start -W
    OS-->>Agent: Status ok, SplashActivity
    Agent->>REA: Read focus after normal initialization
    OS-->>Agent: MainActivity window and focused app
    Agent->>REA: Read verified main PID maps
    REA->>OS: Pull proc maps, read only
    OS-->>Agent: Permission denied
    Note over Agent,OS: No root, login, face, run, proxy or record operation
